            "en": "Althought its best played as an OTK deck with Exhaust draw, it can always work with Tiphera\nWhich creates alot of Exhaustable support cards, Blackhole/Echoes is optional for bonus damage\nBut they cost alot of AP and draw, for realistically not alot of bonus"
