        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E1:\n2 more Futility from Echoes of True Abyss, very good\nE2:\nFree attack for every 2 Futility exhausted (It consumes buffs, so Vuln is bad)\nE3:\nAllows Rift of Nothingless to also Exhaust Futility from Graveyard Very strong\nE4:\n30% Additive is okay\nE5:\nGeneric damage increase, ok\nE6:\nRandom debuff whenever a futility is made, strong (Vuln is OP)"
          }
        }
      ]
